WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.334
Riley: Taking care of a snake is fun!

2
00:00:07.335 --> 00:00:10.009
Snooks: Woof! Woof!

3
00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.181
Theo: Look, Snooks is jealous!

4
00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:19.240
Riley: He wants all the attention.

5
00:00:19.241 --> 00:00:22.242
Sarah: Can I hold Sammy now?

6
00:00:22.243 --> 00:00:25.020
Skyler: I'm next!

7
00:00:25.021 --> 00:00:35.816
Theo: I'm after

8
00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:39.070
Skyler. Kelli, do you want to hold Sammy?

9
00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:43.583
Kelli: Get that thing out of here!

10
00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:45.714
Sarah: I think he's cute.

11
00:00:45.715 --> 00:00:51.881
I wish my mom would let me get a snake.

12
00:00:51.882 --> 00:00:53.964
Ben: It’s time to feed Sammy.

13
00:00:53.965 --> 00:00:56.775
I'll get the snake food.

14
00:00:56.776 --> 00:01:03.951
Sarah: Snake food! Yuck!

15
00:01:03.952 --> 00:01:06.279
Theo: Sammy loves it.

16
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:10.265
Skyler: He's very hungry.

17
00:01:10.266 --> 00:01:12.337
Ben: Don't gobble, Sammy.

18
00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:19.481
You'll get a stomachache.

19
00:01:19.482 --> 00:01:24.383
Hey, look at Johnny's fish aquarium!

20
00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:32.211
Riley: My fish, Goldie and Goofy, would love an aquarium.

21
00:01:32.212 --> 00:01:36.811
Skyler: Maybe we can save money from pet-sitting jobs.

22
00:01:36.812 --> 00:01:41.001
Theo: And buy toys and treats for our pets!

23
00:01:41.002 --> 00:01:44.573
Sarah: I could buy a new collar for Mittens.

24
00:01:44.574 --> 00:01:52.579
Theo: I could build Frankie a frog house.

25
00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:59.064
Ben: Sammy is finished eating now.

26
00:01:59.065 --> 00:02:03.171
Riley: The food made a bump in his stomach.

27
00:02:03.172 --> 00:02:05.809
Sarah: Does Sammy want

28
00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:13.564
dessert? Ben: I don't think snakes eat

29
00:02:13.565 --> 00:02:15.452
dessert. Good-bye, Sammy.

30
00:02:15.453 --> 00:02:18.243
Sarah: We'll see you tomorrow.

31
00:02:18.244 --> 00:02:21.711
Theo: Wait! Something is wrong!

32
00:02:21.712 --> 00:02:24.217
Riley: What's the matter, Theo?

33
00:02:24.218 --> 00:02:31.264
Theo: It's my hamster, Whiskers. He's gone!

